WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Alternator assembly
What it does: Converts mechanical power into electrical energy to supply the vehicle and charge the battery.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Alternator assembly
How it works: The rotating field induces voltage in the stator.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Alternator assembly
How it moves: The housing stays fixed; pulley and rotor turn inside. The exact crankshaft speed ratio is unmeasured.
